THUMB='Registered maxresdefault 1280x720 (HTTP 200, real image). White background: the recurring cartoon man smirking and pointing (black arrow) at a green-glowing SPACEX stock chart rising steeply to above $800, with "ARE YOU IN?" in heavy black capitals. At 320x180 the question and chart read clearly. The chart implies a public price history SpaceX did not yet have (the $0-$800 scale resembles secondary-market prices) and frames FOMO, while the script recommends patience.'
